<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Elec Work - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Elec Work - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		549.16		vs	  518.24</p>
<p> Operating	   30.74		vs	   26.79</p>
<p> Current	     26.68		vs	   22.40</p>
<p> Net		   13.24		vs	   10.98</p>
<p> EPS		   17.10 yen	  vs	   14.68 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    764 million	  vs	 761 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.25 yen	  vs	    6.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Electric Works Ltd is a leading manufacturer of lighting and materials equipment.</p>
